  source_path estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-shadow-context-reused-2026-09.json
  source_path estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-retention-evaluation-2026-09.json
  invariant the official 270M I2_S execution phenotype is bound to a CPU-only x86 compatibility binary; Metal/BLAS-linked x86 compatibility output was empirically non-finite or non-deterministic and is not an eligible runtime substitute
  invariant candidate descriptors enter the BitNet document side only after AddressPlane forwarding and retain every compiled coordinate; task instruction remains query-side and does not create semantic facts
  witness estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-receipt-2026-09.json records nine finite identical repeated candidate vectors across one, two and four threads, then a ResourceAdmission-granted 4891-to-128 AddressPlane cut whose 128 vectors and complete SHADOW ordering were atomically persisted
  witness estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-exact-owner-evidence-2026-09.jsonl records native ForeignTwin retained-body queries for every member of that 128-candidate SHADOW frontier: 104 were observed, with 5/5 retained through rank five and 76/92 through rank ninety-two, without treating retained coverage as relevance or selection
  witness estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-shadow-context-2026-09.json records the exact-owner-intersected top-16 diagnostic aperture: 12 distinct retained bodies fit 197348 Qwen tokens under the pinned GigaToken tokenizer passport; the repeat receipt preserves the same context digest with 15 CID-tokenizer cache hits and zero new tokenizations
  witness estate/generated/bitnet-embedding-270m-i2s-pr606-cpuonly-addressplane-retention-evaluation-2026-09.json measures the complete 128-member live frontier against the independently queried ForeignTwin retained-body predicate: 104 of 128 are retained, while the first 1, 5, and 10 ranks are all retained and rank 16 retains 15; the receipt leaves admission unchanged
  cannot_infer retained-body concentration on one query -> semantic relevance, retrieval preservation across purposes, or ADMIT
  cannot_infer one stable physical execution envelope -> retrieval preservation, false-prune safety, or ADMIT; the 128 ranked candidates still require their preserved ForeignTwin exact verifier and no lowerer handoff was emitted
